[node name="DoggerlandCrowdBlock" type="Node3D" parent="StreamContainer" unique_id=900000000]
editor_description = "H3 (docs/scope_horizon.md) crowd stress-test population — 36 hand-placed NPCBase instances across all five visible archetypes (npc/npc_archetype_data.gd, docs/npc_archetypes.md). This deliberately exceeds the planned 24-active-NPC runtime budget; spawn, pooling and LOD are outside this scene. Density follows npc_archetypes.md §5's Doggerland composition (Vagrant/Thug dominant, Clerk rare); Commuter/Patrolman counts are this scene's own call. Plain scene nodes, no spawner script — not part of StreamingSystems and not generated by any placer, so this group survives streaming and world-content rebuilds."

